; First Steps in Navajo / Diné bizaad (nav)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

yíłtsood box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
bee_bikʼi box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
bąąh_chʼéldzid box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
beesh_bee_haneʼ box         ; Show the final candy count!
